{"id": "msg_520dad2cb84c4757b7cd9a348fe7d435", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9df580d91801e1b3", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\digest.txt (Lines 277-501 of 843) ===\n[Notice: revision=13be8b3b9126fd5cd50fd348b0327ff4a271cdc675e9f9f9b74bd278fc508716; bytes=57073.]\n277 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/technical_pattern/usemoney_area_formatter.md | 7ab660835f96079c ===\n278 | \n279 | # UseMoney Apply Dialog Area Columns Need Dictionary Formatter\n280 | pubUseMoneyApply/detail.vue showPropertyProjectDialog binds street/community columns directly to code fields without using the area mixin formatter to show Chinese names.\n281 | \n282 | ## Problem\n283 | - In pubUseMoneyApply/detail.vue showPropertyProjectDialog, the street (街道) and community (社区) columns bind directly to code fields.\n284 | - They do not use the area mixin's formatter to convert codes to Chinese names.\n285 | \n286 | ## Fix\n287 | - Add formatter: this.subdistrictFormatter and this.communityFormatter to both columns.\n288 | - Depends on detailMixins importing the area mixin to load the dictionary.\n289 | \n290 | ## Verification and Attribution\n291 | - Files: pubUseMoneyApply/detail.vue, ruoyi.js, pubParkingRate/detail.vue, detailMixins.js, assetsLeaseContractFiling/detail.vue, property/useMoneyApply/detail.vue, area.js, zs-select-dialog-func.vue.\n292 | - Project: 园区公共收益; source session: 414b600e-25ec-4a22-8966-2b35fffacd1d; code baseline: none.\n293 | \n294 | ## 验证与归属\n295 | - 所属项目：园区公共收益\n296 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区公共收益\n297 | - 来源会话：414b600e-25ec-4a22-8966-2b35fffacd1d\n298 | \n299 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/前端技术笔记/map_zoom_overview.md | 6ef9806299f829e7 ===\n300 | # Map组件缩放监听误触概览显示\n301 | Map组件监听地图zoom_changed事件并emit clickMark/hoverMark false，导致搜索引发缩放变动时误触发概览内容显示。\n302 | \n303 | ## 问题根因\n304 | - src/components/Map/index.vue 监听地图 zoom_changed 事件\n305 | - 监听回调内 emit clickMark/hoverMark 为 false\n306 | - 搜索操作引发缩放级别变动，间接触发 overview-content 显示\n307 | - 父组件 src/views/benefit/statisticsMap/index.vue 中 @clickMark 绑定 showOverviewContent\n308 | - showOverviewContent 原仅接收 menu 参数并无条件将 contentVisible 设为 true，导致传入 false 也被当作点击标记处理而打开抽屉\n309 | \n310 | ## 解决方案\n311 | - 在 statisticsMap/index.vue 的 showOverviewContent 中增加参数判断，仅当参数为 true 时才设 contentVisible 为 true\n312 | - 保留 Map 组件 zoom_changed 监听逻辑，父组件不再误响应 false 而打开概览\n313 | \n314 | ## 验证与归属\n315 | - 所属项目：repository\n316 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=repository\n317 | - 验证：会话 0c978c4d-3266-400e-856a-6b12b6446659 中搜索导致概览异常显示\n318 | - 涉及文件：src/components/Map/index.vue、src/views/benefit/statisticsMap/index.vue\n319 | - 来源会话ID：0c978c4d-3266-400e-856a-6b12b6446659\n320 | - 代码基线：none\n321 | \n322 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/poll_bg_bug.md | c6eeb2bc71b1d1da ===\n323 | # pages_poll 中因使用 ../.. 导致的背景图片故障\n324 | 文件 `src/pages_poll/result.vue` 和 `form.vue` 错误地使用了 `.\n\n[...]\n\n for scroll logic and add scroll-padding-inline:20px to keep last tab visible.\n454 | \n455 | ## Verification and Attribution\n456 | - Verification source: 园区V0/001.md.\n457 | - Involved files: d:/repository/园区V0/EstateManagement-Base/src/main/webapp/commonJs/BaseJs.js; EstateManagement-Park index.html; bootstrap-tab.js; BaseJs.js; main.css; bootstrap-tab.css; template.css; ServerInterface.js.\n458 | - Source session ID: a726fbc6-506c-419b-8b8c-b02f10958d6b.\n459 | \n460 | ## 验证与归属\n461 | - 所属项目：园区V0\n462 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区V0\n463 | - 来源会话：a726fbc6-506c-419b-8b8c-b02f10958d6b\n464 | \n465 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/org_verify_cascade_clear.md | 97523d1f1edac642 ===\n466 | # 自治用户授权组织核验失败级联清空\n467 | 园区物管2.0 中 autonomy/userAuth/detail.vue 在组织名称核验失败或切换业务类型时须级联清空组织与从属用户字段。\n468 | \n469 | ## 问题根因\n470 | - onOrganizationSelected 调 checkUserUnique 核验组织后，接口失败表单仍保留上一轮选择/回填，用户会误以为已核验通过\n471 | - handleBusinessTypeChange 切换业务类型时也可能残留无效数据\n472 | \n473 | ## 解决方案\n474 | - catch 中不能只 toast：须调用 clearOrganizationFields() 统一清空组织名称、组织版本 ID、物业管理区域、登录名\n475 | - 复用 clearMemberFields 清空姓名/性别/手机号等从属字段；切换业务类型也应走同一清空方法\n476 | \n477 | ## 验证与归属\n478 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区物管2.0\n479 | - 验证：会话 04c36a87 核验失败与换组织失败均需在 catch 中清空组织及关联用户字段\n480 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-web-admin/src/views/autonomy/userAuth/detail.vue\n481 | - 所属项目：园区物管2.0；代码基线：5a288f142；来源会话：04c36a87-d4a7-48a6-bd8d-6bdcfbe29f08\n482 | \n483 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/工作流/subagent_shared_convention.md | a1d1fc6268d58a7d ===\n484 | # 多subagent并行开发共享约定清单\n485 | 拆分HTML原型给多个subagent并行开发看板页面前，需固化共享约定清单以避免不一致隐患。\n486 | \n487 | ## 背景与问题\n488 | - 把HTML原型拆成商品房/存量房/租赁/行业管理/热力等一批Vue菜单页，拆给多个subagent并行，各agent只负责自己1-2个页面，公共mock/图表封装/地图loader由另一agent提供。\n489 | - 各agent看不到彼此实现，易各自造轮子：注册名大小写错误（DaEChart vs DaEchart）、字段名照任务描述写错（heatStock vs实际heatStockList/heatStockDeal）、图表配色硬编码不一致。\n490 | \n491 | ## 约定清单\n492 | - 图表组件统一 import DaEchart from '../components/EChart.vue' + components:{DaEchart} + 模板<da-echart>，注册名必须精确DaEchart，禁写DaEChart。\n493 | - 数据一律来自 ../mock/index.js 具名导出，字段名以实际导出为准，先核对再写（本次描述写heatStock实际heatStockList/heatStockDeal）。\n494 | - 图表option配色/字号统一取 theme.js 的 C/PALETTE/base token，禁页面写死色值。\n495 | - 各自只改自己页面文件，公共mock/components/router/mapLoader由专人先落地维护，agent不得越界。\n496 | - 落盘后由Lead统一构建，不让每个agent各跑一次build。\n497 | \n498 | ## 验证与归属\n499 | - 验证：会话 session-6c46bea2-2d63-4a2d-b33f-f111655982f2（基线a86bf95）子agent结论反复强调统一DaEchart、数据来自mock、option用theme.js、未跑build。\n500 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-web-admin/src/views/dataAnalysis/pages/NewHouse.vue、StockHouse.vue、Rent.vue、IndustryManage.vue、heat/HeatNewProject.vue、heat/HeatStock.vue、heat/HeatRent.vue。\n501 | - 所属项目：zhi2-web-admin；来源会话ID：session-6c46bea2-2d63-4a2d-b33f-f111655982f2；代码基线：a86bf95。\n[Notice: 225 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limi