{"id": "msg_890679ebee6c4ca5b94a1fe9f5bb820a", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9feacffaaa549068", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\digest.txt (Lines 325-453 of 843) ===\n[Notice: revision=13be8b3b9126fd5cd50fd348b0327ff4a271cdc675e9f9f9b74bd278fc508716; bytes=57073.]\n325 | \n326 | ## 问题根因\n327 | - `src/pages_poll/result.vue` 和 `form.vue` 使用了相对路径 `../../static/images/bg_szf.png`\n328 | - 该路径解析到了不存在的 static 根目录，导致加载失败\n329 | \n330 | ## 解决方案\n331 | - 替换为别名路径 `url(\"@/static/images/bg_szf.png\")` 以修正引用\n332 | \n333 | ## 验证与归属\n334 | - 验证证据: extracted source=cursor session=1b86fe06-0678-4ce4-b9df-fbd51273d5c6\n335 | - 涉及文件: src/pages_poll/result.vue, src/pages_poll/form.vue\n336 | - 所属项目: Huishan Fase 2 H5; baseline: none\n337 | \n338 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/无锡市区小程序嵌入h5技术/external_maintenance_house.md | 6b232d59851d8d56 ===\n339 | # 业主维修资金首页走external/maintenanceHouse双步接口\n340 | pages_owner/maintain/index.vue的维修资金链路是GET /external/maintenanceHouse/getToken再POST /external/maintenanceHouse/getHouseInfo，非AppMaintain。\n341 | \n342 | ## 接口链路\n343 | - GET /external/maintenanceHouse/getToken取外部系统token\n344 | - POST /external/maintenanceHouse/getHouseInfo，body含token与houseId（字符串）\n345 | - 完整前缀为VITE_APP_API_BASE_URL或小程序注入的BASE_URL/api/v2.0\n346 | - Toast「查询房屋信息失败」等多为后端返回的msg，经@/api/index.js拦截器统一弹出，表示外部维修资金系统按该房屋唯一号查不到数据\n347 | \n348 | ## 区别与注意\n349 | - 项目内另有/estate/AppMaintain/*（repair.js，如selectAccount）供其他维修资金列表/明细页使用，勿与当前H5首页混查\n350 | - houseId示例H320214000001603\n351 | \n352 | ## 验证与归属\n353 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=无锡市区小程序嵌入H5\n354 | - 来源会话：a343d1aa-9a2b-44b9-9046-e30e130c5be6\n355 | - 验证会话：a343d1aa-9a2b-44b9-9046-e30e130c5be6（基线38bd192），用户截图报错页对应maintain/index.vue\n356 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-mobile-admin-h5-c-unlimited/src/pages_owner/maintain/index.vue、src/api/repair.js、src/api/index.js\n357 | - 所属项目：无锡市区小程序嵌入H5\n358 | \n359 | === viking://user/default/memories/preferences/user/avatar_hover_interaction.md | a2cae14cf77a2ee0 ===\n360 | - In userAvatar.vue, the `.user-info-head` `:hover ::after` pseudo-element overlay mask caused touch devices to only trigger hover on first tap without opening the avatar-edit dialog; removed the hover mask style and kept `cursor:pointer` so the click directly opens the dialog.\n361 | - Files: views/system/user/profile/userAvatar.vue, views/system/user/profile/index.vue\n362 | - Verification: source session 131a52c3-5204-4b7a-b895-8e3be39ebfcb; code baseline none\n363 | \n364 | ## 验证与归属\n365 | - 所属项目：园区公共收益\n366 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区公共收益\n367 | - 来源会话：131a52c3-5204-4b7a-b895-8e3be39ebfcb\n368 | \n369 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/region_tree_indent.md | 74c5ba350ce5ef7d ===\n370 | # 区域银行授权树缩进调整（苏住房G）\n371 | 苏住房G 项目 system/regionBankAuth 左侧树中街道节点缩进调整以明确层级。\n372 | ## 修改要点\n373 | - 街道为最末级，原用 display:none 隐藏展开箭头导致文字左靠\n374 | - 改为保留箭头占位仅隐藏图标（visibility:hidden）以保留缩进\n\n[...]\n\ne `authCode` or `authoCode` and trigger the lingxi link\n408 | - On `onLoad` with no token, set `lingXiAutoLoginTriggered` and execute `startLoginFlow()`\n409 | \n410 | ## Execution chain\n411 | - After `refreshFromServer()`, call `maybeRunLingXiSelectMyHouse()`\n412 | - In non-dev builds, when `authCode === '0'`, do not request `selectMyHouse`\n413 | \n414 | ## Verification and ownership\n415 | - Evidence: extracted source=cursor session=38603878-ea6a-4871-8ac2-8531b6c94bb4\n416 | - Files: pages/webview/externalWebview.vue, pages/user/index/index.vue, utils/portal-user.js, pages/webview/temp.vue\n417 | - Source session: 38603878-ea6a-4871-8ac2-8531b6c94bb4; code baseline: none\n418 | \n419 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/bank_receipt_preview.md | d5a68d17019b9c55 ===\n420 | # bank_receipt_preview\n421 | 产品2.0 的银行回单模块 (`BankReceiptDetailDialog.vue` 等) 调整查看态与编辑态的凭证预览展示。\n422 | \n423 | ## 查看态调整\n424 | - `BankReceiptDetailDialog.vue` 中当 `simplifiedLayout && dialogFormMode === 'view'` 时不再渲染 `BankReceiptForm`，改用 `<DetailTemplate :data=\"publicReceiptDetailItems\" />`。\n425 | - `publicReceiptDetailItems` 与表单字段一一对应（行号、交易时间、监管账号等 17 项），末项为 `凭证预览`（`type: 'image'`，`value` 用 `voucherFileUrl`，无则回退 `voucherFileId`）。\n426 | \n427 | ## 编辑/新增态调整\n428 | - `BankReceiptFormContent.vue` 的 simplified 区块末尾增加整行：标签「凭证预览」的 `el-form-item` 内嵌 `ImageUpload`，`v-model=\"form.voucherF...\"`（原文截断）。\n429 | \n430 | ## 涉及文件与来源\n431 | - 文件：`BankReceiptDetailDialog.vue`、`BankReceiptFormContent.vue`、`BankReceiptForm.vue`、`pubBankReceiptApply/detail.vue`、`index.vue`、`HeadTitle/index.vue`\n432 | - 来源会话：c26c8f38-d604-41d2-b12e-edbdfd3c8e06；项目：产品2.0\n433 | \n434 | ## 验证与归属\n435 | - 所属项目：产品2.0\n436 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\n437 | \n438 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/technical_pattern/tab_scrollbar_bug.md | 63b168df83f0a3d1 ===\n439 | # Tab Scrollbar Bug\n440 | Global CSS scrollbar styling in main.css added left/right arrows to all scrollbars, causing tab bar anomalies and last tab hidden in EstateManagement V0 project.\n441 | \n442 | ## Description\n443 | - Affects tab bar (#myTab) in EstateManagement-Base and EstateManagement-Park webapps.\n444 | - Last tab was squeezed out due to width:88.5% not filling and inaccurate offsetLeft calculation.\n445 | \n446 | ## Root Cause\n447 | - main.css global scrollbar style applied arrows to all scrollbars; tab bar inherited left arrow anomaly.\n448 | - width:88.5% left the bar non-full; offsetLeft calc inaccurate.\n449 | \n450 | ## Solution\n451 | - Hide arrows specifically for #myTab.\n452 | - Change tab bar to left:220px;right:0 to occupy full width.\n453 | - Use getBoundingClientRect for scroll logic and add scroll-padding-inline:20px to keep last tab visible.\n[Notice: 129 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=454; omitted=390; matched=843; failed=0.]\n\n(Omitted 2357 bytes. Full formatted result stored at: C:\\Users\\ADMINI~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-spill-PrMk3N\\session-d9d5d829ae5e\\b5becdecb0e6-ops_inspect_local_file.txt. Use read with offset/limit, or grep this path to search within it.)", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_890679ebee6c4ca5b94a1fe9f5bb820a", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 5932, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-26T19:05:32.028Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
