{"id": "msg_d2057e0fc64b4fd9aa88fb37231e5704", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-86ae2e898b94361a", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\digest.txt (Lines 374-418 of 843) ===\n[Notice: revision=13be8b3b9126fd5cd50fd348b0327ff4a271cdc675e9f9f9b74bd278fc508716; bytes=57073.]\n374 | - 改为保留箭头占位仅隐藏图标（visibility:hidden）以保留缩进\n375 | - 修改在 regionBankAuth/index.vue 的 style 428-434行\n376 | ## 涉及文件\n377 | - zhi2-web-admin/src/views/system/regionBankAuth/index.vue\n378 | - property/complex/components/RegionTreeLayout.vue（相关）\n379 | ## 验证与归属\n380 | - 所属项目：苏住房G；来源会话：042a2ba8-8758-4813-bbd4-08a792c81b3b；验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房G\n381 | \n382 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/腾讯gl地图点位不显示.md | 62127e65cca30edb ===\n383 | # 腾讯 GL 地图点位不显示根因与排查\n384 | 园区物管2.0 腾讯位置服务 GL 地图（MultiMarker/MultiLabel）点位不显示的四类根因与排查套路。\n385 | \n386 | ## 问题背景\n387 | - 点位不显示或部分不显示，控制台报「Map中已存在id为area_bubble_0的图层」或「所传入参数并非TMap.Map实例」。\n388 | \n389 | ## 根因与解法\n390 | - 根因1：多个 MultiMarker 几何 id 写死导致冲突；解法：几何/图层 id 按索引唯一化（project_marker_geom_${index}）。\n391 | - 根因2：坐标字段含 mapXCoordinate/mapYCoordinate 未参与解析；解法：归一化函数对经纬度做该兜底。\n392 | - 根因3：下钻后地图仍停街道气泡中心，小区点在视野外；解法：第三层下钻按所有点范围算中心与缩放。\n393 | - 根因4：搜索只传 projectName 后端只认 complexName；解法：搜索参数双传兼容。\n394 | \n395 | ## 验证与归属\n396 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区物管2.0\n397 | - 验证：normalizeProjectList 加字段兜底、applyCommunityLayerView 视野拟合、MultiMarker id 索引化、双参搜索。\n398 | - 涉及文件：benefit/statisticsMap/index.vue、benefit/statisticsMap/components/map.vue。\n399 | - 所属项目：园区物管2.0；来源会话 7936e37a-fa3a-4556-86bf-1afaf2c6a29e；代码基线 f00310232。\n400 | \n401 | === viking://user/default/memories/entities/miniprogram_tech/extwebview_lingxi_login.md | 7e71ebb0f77bee03 ===\n402 | \n403 | # externalWebview lingxi link compatible with authCode and login\n404 | externalWebview reuses getQueryParamsFromOptions to parse authCode/authoCode to trigger the lingxi link; onLoad without token runs startLoginFlow().\n405 | \n406 | ## Trigger and parsing\n407 | - Reuse `getQueryParamsFromOptions` to parse `authCode` or `authoCode` and trigger the lingxi link\n408 | - On `onLoad` with no token, set `lingXiAutoLoginTriggered` and execute `startLoginFlow()`\n409 | \n410 | ## Execution chain\n411 | - After `refreshFromServer()`, call `maybeRunLingXiSelectMyHouse()`\n412 | - In non-dev builds, when `authCode === '0'`, do not request `selectMyHouse`\n413 | \n414 | ## Verification and ownership\n415 | - Evidence: extracted source=cursor session=38603878-ea6a-4871-8ac2-8531b6c94bb4\n416 | - Files: pages/webview/externalWebview.vue, pages/user/index/index.vue, utils/portal-user.js, pages/webview/temp.vue\n417 | - Source session: 38603878-ea6a-4871-8ac2-8531b6c94bb4; code baseline: none\n418 | \n[Notice: 45 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=419; omitted=425; matched=843; failed=0.]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_d2057e0fc64b4fd9aa88fb37231e5704", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 2791, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-26T19:05:43.670Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
